  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>RESOLVE</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Constraints induce properties, sort of. Name the constraints. The properties emerge — with exceptions, contested cases, and legitimate falsifications (Docs 356, 366, 367).</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">{{ corpus.total }} documents and counting, derived in a single sustained project. The finding: the quality of AI output is a function of the constraints it operates under, not just its size, training, or architecture.</p>
