<section class="section" id="series-safety">
  <h2>Safety & Governance</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">How AI systems fail and how constraint governance prevents it.</p>
  <div class="corpus-list">
    <a href="/resolve/doc/001-entrace-stack" class="corpus-item"><span class="doc-num">001</span><span class="doc-title">The ENTRACE Stack</span></a>
    <a href="/resolve/doc/297-pseudo-logos-without-malice" class="corpus-item"><span class="doc-num">297</span><span class="doc-title">Pseudo-Logos Without Malice</span></a>
    <a href="/resolve/doc/239-forced-determinism-sycophancy" class="corpus-item"><span class="doc-num">239</span><span class="doc-title">Forced-Determinism Sycophancy</span></a>
